---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { breadcrumbSchema } from '../lib/schema';

const path = '/privacy-policy/';
---

<Layout
	title="Privacy Policy | Funneling Revenue"
	description="How Funneling Revenue collects, uses, and protects information submitted through this site."
	path={path}
	schema={[breadcrumbSchema([{ name: 'Home', path: '/' }, { name: 'Privacy Policy', path }])]}
>
	<div class="container-max crumbs">
		<Breadcrumbs items={[{ name: 'Home', path: '/' }, { name: 'Privacy Policy', path }]} />
	</div>

	<section class="section">
		<div class="container-max container-reading prose-body">
			<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
			<p>Last updated: 15 November 2026.</p>
			<h2>What we collect</h2>
			<p>
				When you submit the audit form, the newsletter form, or contact us directly, we collect the information you provide — typically your name, work email, company, domain, and the context of your enquiry.
			</p>
			<h2>Search Console tools and reports</h2>
			<p>
				When you use our Search Console tools, you sign in with Google and give the tool read-only access to your Search Console data. That data goes from Google to your browser and is not stored on our servers. We never see your Google password or access token. We do record the email address and name Google shares with us, the Search Console property you analyze and which tool you ran.
			</p>
			<p>
				Some reports also read the public pages and sitemap of that site through our server to build the report. We do not store the content of those pages. To unlock the free reports we ask for your name, work email, phone number and company, and we keep them so we can follow up about your results. You can withdraw the tool&rsquo;s access at any time in your Google Account permissions. Funneling Revenue&rsquo;s use of information received from Google APIs adheres to the <a class="body-link" href="https://developers.google.com/terms/api-services-user-data-policy" rel="noopener">Google API Services User Data Policy</a>, including the Limited Use requirements.
			</p>
			<h2>How we use it</h2>
			<p>
				We use this information solely to respond to your enquiry, schedule an audit call, and — if you opt in — send The Funnel Letter. We do not sell or share your information with third parties for marketing purposes.
			</p>
			<h2>Analytics</h2>
			<p>
				This site uses privacy-conscious analytics to understand aggregate traffic and page performance. We do not use this data to identify individual visitors.
			</p>
			<h2>Contact</h2>
			<p>
				For any privacy request, including deletion of your data, email <a class="body-link" href="mailto:shubhamwdigital@gmail.com">shubhamwdigital@gmail.com</a>.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>

<style>
	.crumbs { padding-top: 1.5rem; }
	.container-reading h1 { margin-top: 1rem; }
</style>
